{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>CleanStreak Home 是一款以每日五分鐘任務協助維持家居整潔的 App，適合不想在週末一次大掃除、希望把清潔變成日常習慣的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-155.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>每日五分鐘逐區清潔</h2>\n<p>CleanStreak Home 每日提供一個五分鐘任務，按房間順序引導清潔窗戶、牆面配件、表面與地板，並依此循環推進，完成一間再往下一間。每逢第四天改為處理廚房水槽、淋浴間等重點衛生位置。完成連續任務可累積天數，沒有心理遊戲或催促，目標是讓清潔成為日常習慣。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-145-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-146-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-147-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-148-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：CleanStreak Home</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/cleanstreak-home/id6757317342?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T22:07:56.019332+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":289,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T21:55:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:09:57.941916+00:00"